Subject: [PATCH] Simulator Connect: CORS and HTTPS-to-HTTP limits are the
 browser's; the apps reach an http:// bridge natively

---
 Simulator-Connect-he.md | 21 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 Simulator-Connect.md    | 24 +++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 43 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

